# Scoped deliberately to these launchers only -- a repo-wide "* text=auto"
# would renormalize every tracked file in one noisy commit.
#
# The Maven wrapper's POSIX script has to keep LF endings: with CRLF it dies
# as "bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M". The Windows launchers want CRLF.
mvnw       text eol=lf
mvnw.cmd   text eol=crlf
choleil.cmd text eol=crlf
